  "notes": "Swap allows you to toggle the visibility of two elements using a checkbox or a class name.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/swap/+page.md",
  "code": "<label class=\"swap\">\n  <!-- this hidden checkbox controls the state -->\n  <input type=\"checkbox\" />\n\n  <!-- volume on icon -->\n  <svg\n    class=\"swap-on fill-current\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n    width=\"48\"\n    height=\"48\"\n    viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n    <path\n      d=\"M14,3.23V5.29C16.89,6.15 19,8.83 19,12C19,15.17 16.89,17.84 14,18.7V20.77C18,19.86 21,16.28 21,12C21,7.72 18,4.14 14,3.23M16.5,12C16.5,10.23 15.5,8.71 14,7.97V16C15.5,15.29 16.5,13.76 16.5,12M3,9V15H7L12,20V4L7,9H3Z\" />\n  </svg>\n\n  <!-- volume off icon -->\n  <svg\n    class=\"swap-off fill-current\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n    width=\"48\"\n    height=\"48\"\n    viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n    <path\n      d=\"M3,9H7L12,4V20L7,15H3V9M16.59,12L14,9.41L15.41,8L18,10.59L20.59,8L22,9.41L19.41,12L22,14.59L20.59,16L18,13.41L15.41,16L14,14.59L16.59,12Z\" />\n  </svg>\n</label>",
